{"about_the_game":"<i>&quot;You know, what surprised me most, was not that they went that far with genetic mutations. Or, that somehow this god-knows-what strain popped out in somebody\u2019s system and started spreading. Nah, that\u2019s child\u2019s play compared to their crazy plan. <br><br>They tried to hide it. You think I\u2019m joking, right? I wish I was. <br><br>Truth is, they never stood a chance. We never stood a chance.&quot;</i><br><br><br>Fovos is a post-apocalyptic horror, rail shooter for the HTC Vive, set in a future where an omnipotent AI is taking over human brains through genetic implants. Even if you survive, will there be anything left to live with?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story-driven Single Player Campaign<br></li><li>Survival mode - Fight against hordes of incoming zombies to rock the leaderboards (leaderboard integration coming soon)</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/576650?t=1744292576","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/576650?t=1744292576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/576650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744292576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/576650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744292576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<i>&quot;You know, what surprised me most, was not that they went that far with genetic mutations. Or, that somehow this god-knows-what strain popped out in somebody\u2019s system and started spreading. Nah, that\u2019s child\u2019s play compared to their crazy plan. <br><br>They tried to hide it. You think I\u2019m joking, right? I wish I was. <br><br>Truth is, they never stood a chance. We never stood